or":"aaaaaa","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1752040694,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxNzUyMDQwNjk0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:navigation","name":"topic:navigation","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666708289,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA4Mjg5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:3d","name":"topic:3d","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":12,"created_at":"2025-06-17T15:54:28Z","updated_at":"2026-01-07T08:37:29Z","closed_at":"2026-01-03T08:34:32Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n4.4.1 stable on windows 11.\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.4.1.stable.mono - Windows 11 (build 26100) - Multi-window, 1 monitor - Vulkan (Forward+) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce RTX 5090 (NVIDIA; 32.0.15.7652) - AMD Ryzen 9 9950X3D 16-Core Processor (32 threads)\n\n### Issue description\n\nProject is using navigation3d demo. (just for example, I found this bug in my own project too).\nhttps://godotengine.org/asset-library/asset/2743\nThe bug represents as stuck/jitter, but inner cause is NavigationAgent keeps giving same point. So of course object won't move anywhere.\nI didn't use the original code, but requested a re-calc path every frame (using same target_position).\n`character.gd`\n```gdscript\nfunc _physics_process(delta):\n\t_nav_agent.target_position = _target_pos\n\t\n\tif _nav_agent.is_navigation_finished():\n\t\treturn\n\tvar next_position := _nav_agent.get_next_path_position()\n\tvar offset := next_position - global_position\n\tglobal_position = global_position.move_toward(next_position, delta * character_speed)\n\t# Make the robot look at the direction we're traveling.\n\t# Clamp y to 0 so the robot only looks left and right, not up/down.\n\toffset.y = 0\n\tlook_at(global_position + offset, Vector3.UP)\n```\n\n\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1.download https://godotengine.org/asset-library/asset/2743\n2.open with godot 4.4.1\n3.change character.gd to code above. (or set a position every frame in your own way)\n4.run and see bug.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[navigation.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/20778923/navigation.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"EricDeng1001","id":28720903,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI4NzIwOTAz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/28720903?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/EricDeng1001","html_url":"https://github.com/EricDeng1001","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EricDeng1001/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EricDeng1001/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EricDeng1001/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EricDeng1001/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EricDeng1001/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EricDeng1001/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EricDeng1001/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EricDeng1001/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EricDeng1001/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107638/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107638/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":nu